<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CARRIG TO SELL REXCOR TO CANADIAN PARENT.</title>
<headline>CARRIG TO SELL REXCOR TO CANADIAN PARENT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carrig Diamonds Ltd said on Thursday it planned to dispose of its shareholding in wholly-owned subsidiary Rex Mining Corp (Rexcor) for cash to its Canadian controlling shareholder Rex Diamond Mining Corp.</p>
<p>Carrig will then distribute approximately 90 percent of its cash resources to Carrig shareholders by way of a reduction in the share premium account.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
